37623>>>    Procedure OnNavigateForward tWebNavigateData NavigateData Integer hoInvokingView Integer hoInvokingObject
37626>>>        WebSet pbRender of oNewButton to True
37627>>>        WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to True
37628>>>
37628>>>        Case Begin
37628>>>            Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromParent)
37630>>>                // If from parent, this is a constrained drill down
37630>>>                Case Break
37631>>>
